Subject: [PATCH v16 02/12] media: mediatek: jpeg: fix jpeg buffer payload size setting
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 21:34:22 +0800
Message-ID: <20260720133432.1042046-3-kyrie.wu@mediatek.com>
